Error [E2807]: Route `/order-items` is registered both by `routes_same_words/OrderItems.jet` and `routes_same_words/order-items.jet`
  --> tests/ui/web_app_routes_same_words.jet:4:22
    |
  4 | fn run() { web.app().routes(from: "routes_same_words").csr().serve() }
    |                      ^^^^^^
 Why: Explicit builder entries and `.routes(from:)` conventions must not claim the same path.
 Fix: Remove one registration, or rename the convention file.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2807
